            <div xml:id="m-d9f5994f-3f25-42ae-ac34-08d3f5f0fc9d">
              <lg xml:id="m-9f1c08b7-bb6a-4a3b-a7cc-e70a1868b778">
                <l xml:id="m-b7ab0b2a-19d8-433b-94ee-a287d3f0b03d" facs="#m-a47a3e5a-7845-4d48-9147-78210761293f" label="ambiguous">903</l><l xml:id="m-9e03f215-60fe-4cf3-a78d-7e0d0b021e9e" facs="#m-a57e950a-a88c-4123-88cf-f7caca52ca93" label="ambiguous">Ember Saturday.</l><l xml:id="m-6be7c8af-6bdf-45ad-9f8e-b8905ecaaf81" facs="#m-b84add23-f8ae-4752-8655-613b9bd777af" label="ambiguous">Lesson III.</l><l xml:id="m-8163300a-c6f7-4c92-8025-15e42900bc31" facs="#m-c976e32d-7e39-40f9-aedc-c04428e5ee97" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Deuteronomii. Deut. 26.</l><l xml:id="m-65a47b9b-45e9-4272-a2e6-dbc9d015aaf7" facs="#m-395bd23f-bd0c-48fe-9fca-f01254e0f9c4" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Dixit Móyses filiis nostram, et labórem, atque angú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ad74f44f-3688-49df-8be8-f40797713cf7" facs="#m-ae4a725b-a5ab-490a-a534-8117ffb17cef" label="ambiguous">L Israel: Audi, Israel, quae ego</l><l xml:id="m-6cc0108a-8087-4f76-9771-2a320bf0aa48" facs="#m-d4f05188-48c9-4a03-acdc-387f589ac5cd" label="lyrics-like">stiam: et edúxit nos de Aegypto</l><l xml:id="m-42c7b01c-237b-45fe-9eb5-3adc4d213168" facs="#m-333e016e-4ed0-4c04-ab04-898e8aa7a6d0" label="lyrics-like">praecipio tibi hódie. Cum intráveris</l><l xml:id="m-bbcea791-ab93-4167-b1c3-6539c88356eb" facs="#m-69e1d0be-f858-4f23-8bb5-35857d19039e" label="lyrics-like">in manu forti, et bráchio exténto,</l><l xml:id="m-bf0dedfd-cd72-4492-80f1-2fff6116a177" facs="#m-bc373983-afab-4f4c-a906-490f321ac402" label="lyrics-like">terram, quam Dóminus Deus tuus</l><l xml:id="m-12e2a1df-47fa-40b0-a99f-1e8cbcf04cad" facs="#m-e1b71e8b-a26f-4f05-a53a-f13f8fcb435b" label="lyrics-like">in ingénti pavóre, in signis atque</l><l xml:id="m-dcd90105-dc15-45ee-b1b5-42047e9d5c07" facs="#m-699bd5da-e3aa-4a21-9ea7-b83b9e32cf4b" label="lyrics-like">tibi datúrus est possidéndam, et</l><l xml:id="m-f47471e5-3425-47b2-a0ff-e419b35c29af" facs="#m-f469d032-6bfd-47d3-b65f-75713e8fe30b" label="lyrics-like">porténtis: et introdúxit ad locum</l><l xml:id="m-0190cabf-5c0f-43d7-9b07-7ce65a10646c" facs="#m-9c107455-8a30-4458-ae88-9c605ed83d19" label="lyrics-like">obtinúeris eam, atque habitáveris</l><l xml:id="m-5947b474-d741-4190-b2f3-2d0c386ecafa" facs="#m-bf546bd7-3bed-4c4e-8202-ec54b596a772" label="lyrics-like">istum, et trádidit nobis terram lacte</l><l xml:id="m-71e3fabe-3b3a-4217-8c9b-b373f755b41e" facs="#m-7827b8ca-e6cc-4b62-b97c-420a55ba6be5" label="lyrics-like">in ea: tolles de cunctis frúgibus</l><l xml:id="m-fe74ce6d-96d4-4d64-9d75-ea557a854d28" facs="#m-706c57c4-24e6-4089-a3f6-b3724f2e0d82" label="lyrics-like">et melle manántem. Et idcirco nunc</l><l xml:id="m-611326b3-4e98-45ac-91c2-d440d1647c9f" facs="#m-5d7de65b-fa38-486e-8cf2-1bdf3936492c" label="lyrics-like">tuis primítias, et pones in cartállo,</l><l xml:id="m-6aa03dbd-6cdf-4cd7-819c-f67305cfaa17" facs="#m-def190ca-fb43-41e0-baa7-3067cdebd87d" label="lyrics-like">óffero primítias frugum terrae.</l><l xml:id="m-6262bf9b-6282-445b-9a37-b92f5b6cbafc" facs="#m-dbd7629f-668b-43a8-b382-ea55d2c2bcf4" label="lyrics-like">quam Dóminus dedit mihi. Et di¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4eb1d36-1855-41b5-89c1-2ae52bdf9dcf" facs="#m-693bb0ca-ebee-4cce-b654-d88e32b5309d" label="lyrics-like">pergésque ad locum, quem Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-585d0373-8d7a-4580-8ac4-3a25ae0ba415" facs="#m-e8e717f9-b6c9-475b-93ef-b071570e9798" label="lyrics-like">mittes eas in conspéctu Dómini Dei</l><l xml:id="m-7c575a4e-605c-4c64-8a1b-30ffe773bd15" facs="#m-47d00108-29d5-4f0b-aa13-60bde4e14d76" label="lyrics-like">Deus tuus elégerit, ut ibi invocétur</l><l xml:id="m-24c05d8b-6f3c-4958-b3d3-7c5a20bb1c5e" facs="#m-1ed6e8d6-9ada-423c-9cc1-80c3eff3beae" label="lyrics-like">tui: et adoráto Dómino Deo tuo.</l><l xml:id="m-d7be3607-f54e-4b05-be0b-3d0947f0ec4d" facs="#m-d21a73e6-48c9-4c4b-8ddc-3273b354542d" label="lyrics-like">nomen eius : accedésque ad sacer¬</l><l xml:id="m-061abee9-19e7-48d8-b6f6-b6e81cb0a1bd" facs="#m-4f61f28f-a336-43de-b988-dcf7edd40b95" label="lyrics-like">dótem, qui fuerit in diébus illis, et</l><l xml:id="m-559692db-c8cb-4ce9-beca-5bf5f37d938f" facs="#m-b4aae965-4ee3-41e8-85c1-daf3ab785f01" label="lyrics-like">Et epuláberis in ómnibus bonis,</l><l xml:id="m-7ef5958d-7fb9-4bb6-9ebd-54dd9919808b" facs="#m-a9dd264b-c6c8-4eb9-8001-b1536b5d3c18" label="lyrics-like">dices ad eum: Profiteor hódie</l><l xml:id="m-0df49aac-6461-4bc9-a786-7881febc43f9" facs="#m-f7abbae9-5d41-414f-a9d5-5210eb7a6866" label="lyrics-like">quae Dóminus Deus tuus déderit</l><l xml:id="m-51cbf6bf-30a7-4f91-adac-54d57b787b1e" facs="#m-c547b7bd-f41a-4038-824e-bf0fea248ac3" label="lyrics-like">coram Dómino Deo tuo, qui exau¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9a6303f-1b39-4999-bbb6-b6588482624d" facs="#m-fb6faed8-d865-465a-9b7b-887dd78f7600" label="ambiguous">tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-35c1c260-1e91-4be0-9553-ab078949d871" facs="#m-df9e91f2-a1db-4208-91d6-ae9d32d8b1ce" label="lyrics-like">divit nos, et respéxit humilitátem</l><l xml:id="m-076cd700-72bf-4372-9b71-c9ce16b1033c" facs="#m-7b892559-b553-4465-8ac9-673024ec9204" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-8e99db92-f319-4284-a7b3-367aa51b2f6e" facs="#m-3c991089-96f1-411f-b5c1-2da93d84e333" label="lyrics-like">ALle- lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-98d69b8b-e37b-4b62-a728-0c1916069d44" facs="#m-735988f5-8a12-43cb-b2ed-cccdf3b93996" label="lyrics-like">V. Dum comple-réntur</l><l xml:id="m-5b5133ed-c414-4749-b264-b2431fc550d1" facs="#m-d78319ec-6094-4255-a9f7-452cc45a5606" label="lyrics-like">é- rant ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-291effdc-99c7-4a11-9b78-c133780d07bf" facs="#m-5b8d89fb-a9fe-4994-aee0-845fd926c6b7" label="lyrics-like">dí-es Pen-te¬</l><l xml:id="m-7582b592-e85e-45c0-afc8-5cdad1f7de44" facs="#m-ef052e2f-5100-4ca8-999a-8600870cb664" label="lyrics-like">có- stes,</l><l xml:id="m-0d05a6b3-8c2d-4fa7-9087-3fe3fa24a86a" facs="#m-53ac8a59-64c7-4212-8b2e-c7f99492495e" label="lyrics-like">mnes pá-ri- ter * se- déntes.</l><l xml:id="m-c545435c-5d43-4031-b466-fa5b5aaea183" facs="#m-31554af6-83aa-4a8c-8ece-341b4a033cf6" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-f8ab9570-e14f-4625-b576-4b53159a0f50" facs="#m-8354ec1a-e40a-4653-9716-4bf0c0a5c81e" label="lyrics-like">Raesta, quaésumus omnípotens] abstinéntes, * propitiatiónem tuam</l><l xml:id="m-bb51d8bc-2574-4f8f-9065-eb8919d65ce8" facs="#m-2a5e52b8-8394-441f-8509-d302a355d47f" label="lyrics-like">Deus: f ut salutáribus jejúniis! facilius impetrémus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-651b911a-e905-4883-8354-2f536c0c1a10" facs="#m-971d101c-68f9-44be-af4a-03177dec1a8b" label="lyrics-like">eruditi, ab omnibus étiam vitiis</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
